+/// can match is found under the criterion's own key.
+#[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]
+pub enum IndexKey {
+    /// A number as [`compare_numbers`] tells numbers apart: rounded to 15 significant digits,
+    /// with `-0` as `0`.
+    Number(u64),
+    /// Text lower-cased one char at a time, as wildcard matching compares it.
